# Build context for backend/Dockerfile (T-020 step 2b). An allowlist: everything is left out except
# what is named below, so .env, private/, backend/data/ (local Qdrant), logs and any new file are
# never sent to the image builder unless someone adds them here on purpose.
*
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/uv.lock
!backend/src/
!demo_runs/*.json
!knowledge_base/index_info.json

# Even inside allowed folders: no bytecode caches.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
